# Production build (npm run build) for the LAN deployment.
#
# Caddy serves the built SPA and proxies /api/* to the API container on the same
# origin (see deploy/Caddyfile.site), so a relative base is all that is needed —
# and it keeps the bundle free of any hardcoded host, which means the same dist/
# works whatever address the server answers on. src/api/client.ts reads this.
VITE_API_URL=/api
